   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Retries and dead letters, note 4 of 5: set a failed record aside with its evidence, so the main flow moves on.\nA human diagnoses and replays it later (S3-F5, preparing S3-F6). Read top to bottom, following the black arrows.",
   "originalText": "Retries and dead letters, note 4 of 5: set a failed record aside with its evidence, so the main flow moves on.\nA human diagnoses and replays it later (S3-F5, preparing S3-F6). Read top to bottom, following the black arrows.",
   "fontSize": 36,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
